  "solution": "** [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/139fd23928341a2470b7467865d7371c095a65b4a0823ef0b42de5e5c6602abc.png] **\n\n**Give: **15 - 54 × 18 + 16 ÷ 2 = 44\n\nAccording to the question, \n\nLet's check options one by one.\n\nOption 1) - and +\n\n⇒ 15 + __54 × 18__ - __16 ÷ 2__ = 44\n\n​⇒ __**15 + 972**__ - 8 = 44\n\n​⇒ __**987 - 8**__ = 44\n\n​⇒ 979 ≠ 44\n\nOption 2) + and ×\n\n​⇒ 15 - 54 + 18 × __**16 ÷ 2**__ = 44\n\n​⇒ 15 - 54 + __**18 × 8**__ = 44\n\n​⇒**__​ 15__** - 54 __**+ 144**__ = 44\n\n​⇒1__**59 - 54**__ = 44\n\n​⇒ 1-5 ≠ 44.\n\n**Option 3) **÷** and ×**\n\n​⇒ 15 - __**54 ÷ 18**__ + __**16 × 2**__ = 44\n\n​⇒ __**15**__ - 3 __**+ 32**__ = 44\n\n​⇒ **47 - 3 = 44**​\n\nOption 4) - and ÷\n\n​⇒ __**15 **÷ 54__ × 18 + 16 - 2 = 44\n\n​⇒ __**0.27 × 18**__ + 16 - 2 = 44\n\n​⇒​ __**5 + 16**__ - 2 = 44\n\n​⇒ 21 - 2 = 44\n\n​⇒ 19 ≠ 44.\n\nHence, the correct answer is** \"Option 3\".**\n\n2f:Ta2c,\n\n<",
